{"about_the_game":"New DLC for Breeze of Passion: Deep Inspection invites you back to your dream hotel - a sun-kissed haven built on love, laughter, and daring adventure.<br>But just as the gentle ocean breeze promises a happily-ever-after, a storm rolls in under the name of a bitter inspector determined to ruin your hard-won bliss.<br><br>Sent by powerful business elites from Emma\u2019s past who refuse to accept her newfound happiness, this cunning inspector will stop at nothing to find fault in your hotel.<br>The stakes have never been higher: not only is your business on the line, but so are the hearts of those you\u2019ve grown to love.<br><br>It seems that it's impossible to solve this problem, and even those closest to you had close to zero faith in a bright future. But you can ignite a fire of hope inside them, because you are not alone!<br>All your favorite characters from Breeze of Passion are returning to help you!<br>Expect plenty of adventures, plot twists, and spicy scenes as you gather your loyal team of heroines to protect your paradise!<br><br>Deep Inspection is not just a small epilogue.<br>Hours of new content await you!<br>Lots of scenes with already beloved and new characters as well.<br>Both girls and hot MILFs are ready to dive with you into a world of kink and ecstasy you haven't experienced before!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You will even get a chance to have a spicy encounter with three girls at once!</h2><br>Can you defeat the cold grip of envy and bureaucracy?<br>Will you charm the unyielding inspector and protect your dream against all odds?<br>There's only one way to find out: jump into Deep Inspection and learn that an inspection can be the beginning of something very, very exciting...<br><br><strong>More girls and MILFs\u2014even more fun!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 5 hours of gameplay<br></li><li>About 5,300 images<br></li><li>Tons and tons of spicy animations!<br></li><li>MoCap inserts tha